# Internal research notes -- not published.
# Remove this line to include it in the repo.
ADDITIONAL.md

# Live coordination between agents sharing this working tree: claims on files,
# not history. Local by design -- a claim from another machine's session is
# noise at best and a stale lock at worst.
COLLABORATION.md

# `tsc ... > nul` on Windows writes a file: `nul` is a device name in cmd.exe
# but not in the POSIX shells used here, so the redirect is captured instead of
# discarded. Ignored so a stray one is never committed again.
nul
nul.d.ts

